   Aboye, Teshome L., Univ Addis Ababa, Sch Pharm, Dept Pharmaceut Chem, Addis Ababa, Ethiopia.
   Rosengren, K. Johan, Univ Queensland, Sch Biomed Sci, Brisbane, Qld 4072, Australia.},
