Abstract = {This review focuses on plant peptides involved in defense against
   pathogen infection and those involved in the regulation of growth and
   development. Defense peptides, defensins, cyclotides and anti-microbial
   peptides are compared and contrasted. Signaling peptides are classified
   according to their major sites of activity. Finally, a network approach
   to creating an interactomic peptide map is described. C) 2014 Elsevier
   Inc. All rights reserved.},
